  "notes": "Used the full 'All Guests' roster at app.mysticonva.com/guests (121 cards) rather than just the 6 Featured Guests shown on the main homepage, per the rule to prefer the All-Guests page; the homepage's own 9-candidate guest extraction was superseded by this fuller page and not cited, to avoid double-picking the same 6 headliners. Known-for is each card's own short tagline where one exists (e.g. 'Doctor by day, novelist by night'); most cards only carry role chips (Author/Artist/Film/Gaming/Science/Paranormal/Fandom/Media/Music/Costuming) with no personal tagline, so Known-for is left blank for those and cat is picked from whichever chip best fits the allowed categories (role chips themselves are not specific credits, so per the no-guessing rule they were not copied into Known-for). 'Paranormal' and 'Science' and bare 'Fandom' chips have no matching category, so those default to 'author' when paired with an Author chip, otherwise 'other'. Cover uses CHL, the con's mascot art, since the homepage has no og/twitter image and the alternative is a plain text logo. Verify pass (2026-10-05): confirmed current -- a fresh fetch retitles the page 'Guests | MystiCon 2027' and guest #81 Matthew Correll's own bio reads 'MystiCon 2027 Gaming Director', so the full 121-guest roster is this edition's, not last year's."
